<title>HONG KONG: Philippines considers end to capital account curbs.</title>
<headline>Philippines considers end to capital account curbs.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine central bank is considering ending all restrictions on capital account, its governor Gabriel C. Singson said in Hong Kong on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;We are studying with the view to relaxing and probably dismantling all remaining restrictions on capital account,&quot; Singson said at a conference hosted by the International International Fund and Hong Kong Monetary Authority.</p>
</text>
